    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The release... that's all I can think about. To just stop the pulling. To stop the noise. Everything feels so heavy and the silence you mentioned, it's almost inviting. Like a way out of the weight. It's like the sword is telling me that the only way to truly find that peace is to embrace the end of the story.",
